{"meta":{"id":"mapped-types","category":"it/syntax/typescript/types","title":"타입 변환 (Mapped Type) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"[K in keyof T] 로 모든 속성을 선택 · 필수 · 읽기 전용 · 문자열로 바꾸는 타입 변환 함수","tags":["typescript","f-type-transform","f-generic"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">타입 변환 (Mapped Type) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> [K in keyof T] 로 모든 속성을 선택 · 필수 · 읽기 전용 · 문자열로 바꾸는 타입 변환 함수</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">타입 변환 함수 (Mapped Type)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">문법</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">같은 내장 타입</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>[K in keyof T]?: T[K]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">모든 속성을 선택으로 변경</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Partial&lt;T&gt;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>[K in keyof T]-?: T[K]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">모든 속성을 필수로 변경</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Required&lt;T&gt;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>readonly [K in keyof T]: T[K]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">모든 속성을 읽기 전용으로 변경</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Readonly&lt;T&gt;</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>[K in keyof T]: string</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">모든 속성의 타입을 문자열로 변경</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Record&lt;keyof T, string&gt;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">형태</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">type Optional&lt;T&gt; = {\r\n  [K in keyof T]?: T[K];        // 1. 모든 속성을 선택으로\r\n};\r\n\r\ntype Mandatory&lt;T&gt; = {\r\n  [K in keyof T]-?: T[K];       // 2. 모든 속성을 필수로\r\n};\r\n\r\ntype Frozen&lt;T&gt; = {\r\n  readonly [K in keyof T]: T[K]; // 3. 모든 속성을 읽기 전용으로\r\n};\r\n\r\ntype Stringify&lt;T&gt; = {\r\n  [K in keyof T]: string;       // 4. 모든 속성의 타입을 문자열로\r\n};</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>keyof T</code> 는 T 의 속성 이름들, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>K in …</code> 는 그 이름을 하나씩 돌면서 새 타입을 만든다. <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>T[K]</code> 는 원래 속성의 타입</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">사용 예</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">interface User { id: number; name: string; email?: string }\r\n\r\ntype UserPatch = Optional&lt;User&gt;;   // { id?: number; name?: string; email?: string }\r\ntype UserFull  = Mandatory&lt;User&gt;;  // { id: number; name: string; email: string }\r\ntype UserView  = Frozen&lt;User&gt;;     // 모든 속성 readonly\r\ntype UserForm  = Stringify&lt;User&gt;;  // { id: string; name: string; email?: string }\r\n\r\nconst patch: UserPatch = { name: &quot;kim&quot; }; // 일부만 보내는 수정 요청</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/types/mapped-types","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/typescript/types"}],"hasImage":false}